1
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,800
Yang Rui.

3
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:54,920
Thanks.

4
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,280
I owe you one again.

5
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:59,120
I'll take you out for a nice meal.

6
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,240
No need.

7
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,680
You're a good girl.

8
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:08,199
And it's not the first time I've seen
Lin Long snooping through your files.

9
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:09,400
<i>As your senior,</i>
<i>I thought I should tell you.</i>

10
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,800
<i>Be more careful</i>
<i>with your work from now on.</i>

11
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:32,680
Is Yang Rui into you?

12
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,840
Don't just accept his help
without giving him anything back.

13
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:44,120
Can…

14
00:02:44,640 --> 00:02:46,040
Can you thank Zhao Heng for me?

15
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,080
He helped me mostly because of you.

16
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,760
You're changing the subject.

17
00:03:00,200 --> 00:03:02,560
I'm not thanking him. Thank him yourself.

18
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:03,480
Okay, on to business.

19
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:06,120
How did you know Lin Long
would take the bait?

20
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:10,480
After Yang Rui warned me last time,
I started paying attention.

21
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,920
She used to be my mentor,

22
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,600
so we share the same
company database account.

23
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,720
<i>I checked her browsing history</i>
<i>from the past two days</i>

24
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,640
<i>and found that most of it</i>

25
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:21,560
was related to C&amp;C Consulting, Ye Xinzhi,
and Tianhe Air.

26
00:03:21,640 --> 00:03:23,720
And with what Zhao Heng told me,

27
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:24,720
I was even more certain.

28
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,760
So I pretended to be
on the phone with Ye Xinzhi.

29
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,680
And sure enough,

30
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,120
<i>-I caught her eavesdropping.</i>
-Yes. It's been signed.

31
00:03:30,200 --> 00:03:31,040
Yes.

32
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,880
This is all thanks to you, Richard.

33
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:34,840
Okay.

34
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,800
Send the documents over by courier then.

35
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,120
I'll review them right away.

36
00:03:40,920 --> 00:03:44,520
So what about the signature
that mysteriously disappeared?

37
00:03:45,560 --> 00:03:47,440
Fading ink from the stationery store.

38
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,520
The writing is clear
for the first half hour.

39
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:53,320
But the longer it's exposed to air,
the more obvious the oxidation reaction.

40
00:03:54,600 --> 00:03:55,440
FIRST COPY-CONFIDENTIAL DOCUMENT
ACKNOWLEDGMENT-OF-RECEIPT FORM

41
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,360
SIGNEE

42
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,640
RECEIVED BY OCTOBER 6, 2025

43
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,040
This is impossible.

44
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,200
-Impressive.
-That's terrifying.

45
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,160
I'm never crossing you now.

46
00:04:07,920 --> 00:04:11,200
Don't be like that.
We helped our friend out together.

47
00:04:11,880 --> 00:04:13,560
-Zhao Heng.
-Yes.

48
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:15,480
You're a good man.

49
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:19,920
But don't waste your time on me.
It's useless. Got it?

50
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:24,320
If you spent that time and energy
on some other girl,

51
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:27,760
maybe by this time next year,
I'd be giving your kid a red envelope.

52
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:29,720
Kid?

53
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,840
You're already thinking about having kids.

54
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,960
I was just thinking
about some casual flirting.

55
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:40,360
How do you think Sha Sha
will handle Lin Long?

56
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:45,080
Probably not much.

57
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:47,080
Labor law, you know.

58
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,360
But at least one thing's for sure.

59
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:52,320
I won't be pushed around
by her so easily anymore.

60
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:55,560
She set me up.

61
00:04:57,400 --> 00:04:58,920
She set me up.

62
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,760
She set me up.

63
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,920
It was all part of her plan.

64
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:23,560
Weren't her accusations true?

65
00:05:24,080 --> 00:05:28,320
If you hadn't been so paranoid,
constantly accusing and suppressing her,

66
00:05:28,400 --> 00:05:30,640
and if you hadn't walked
right into her trap,

67
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:32,880
would things have escalated to this point?

68
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:39,040
You always say Xu Chi is scheming
to replace you.

69
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,280
But from where I stand,

70
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:41,800
she's way better at playing
the game than you are.

71
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:44,120
She held in all her resentment

72
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:47,280
and only let it all out
at the crucial moment.

73
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:50,920
She asked me for a resolution,
but didn't pressure me into a decision.

74
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:55,160
Lin Long, I don't want to hurt you.

75
00:05:55,760 --> 00:05:58,680
But please, with the calmness
and thoroughness

76
00:05:58,760 --> 00:06:01,960
expected of a qualified consultant,
tell me, if you were in my shoes,

77
00:06:02,960 --> 00:06:04,440
how would you resolve this?

78
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,840
If you want to fire me, just say so.

79
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:09,720
No need to beat around the bush.

80
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:11,920
Of course not!

81
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:15,800
Lin Long. Why are you so sensitive
and neurotic?

82
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:19,200
I suggest you take
your maternity leave early!

83
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,320
That's impossible!

84
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:21,840
My due date is still two months away.

85
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,800
I have to work till the end!

86
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,680
Look at your condition right now.
Are you fit to work?

87
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,760
I haven't received a single work report
from you lately!

88
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:31,200
Aside from monitoring Xu Chi,
have you been involved in any projects?

89
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,080
Have you been putting in any effort?

90
00:06:35,600 --> 00:06:36,440
Lin Long, listen.

91
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:39,120
Choosing when to take
your maternity leave is your right,

92
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:42,240
but assigning what work after your leave
is my responsibility.

93
00:06:48,400 --> 00:06:50,360
We need to stay in close contact with Bolo

94
00:06:50,440 --> 00:06:52,760
during the execution phase
of this project.

95
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,840
This is a good opportunity.

96
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:56,080
Learn from a few directors.

97
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:57,760
Got it. Let me get that for you.

98
00:07:00,360 --> 00:07:01,800
Heng, where is she?

99
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:07,640
Lin's not feeling well. She applied
for early maternity leave with HR.

100
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,280
Sha Sha had Lu Le take over her projects.

101
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:19,960
I tried everything
and couldn't make it happen,

102
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,400
but you did.

103
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,960
Not bad.

104
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:26,080
Just reaping what others sowed.

105
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:29,280
On the Bolo Culture project,
I'm just a grunt.

106
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,960
Here's the document you asked for.

107
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,600
NO. 92, YONG'AN ROAD

108
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:53,360
UNIT 1

109
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,320
Miss Xu, here to see the place again?

110
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,160
Yeah.

111
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,040
But I can't even afford
the down payment right now.

112
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:11,680
The owner of 201 keeps saying
the price has dropped too much.

113
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,720
Selling now wouldn't be worth it.

114
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,960
Maybe by the time
you have the down payment ready,

115
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,240
he'll be willing to sell.

116
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,200
Could you contact the owner?

117
00:08:19,280 --> 00:08:21,080
At least let me take a look at the place.

118
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:22,000
I can pay for it.

119
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:24,520
Well… I'll try.

120
00:08:26,960 --> 00:08:28,520
Please try your best for me.

121
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,560
Let me know if you hear anything.

122
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:30,560
-Okay.
-Thanks.

123
00:08:30,640 --> 00:08:31,480
Bye.

124
00:08:54,000 --> 00:08:54,840
Spotting.

125
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,920
Cervix is a bit short too.

126
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:58,480
There's a risk of premature labor.

127
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,280
I know you have a busy job,

128
00:09:00,360 --> 00:09:03,560
but in this condition,
you really should rest more.

129
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:09,040
-But I'm already on maternity leave.
-That's good.

130
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,200
I'll prescribe a week of progesterone
to support the pregnancy.

131
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:16,800
I came today because I wanted you to
prescribe something to regulate my mood.

132
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:20,640
A lot of people have been saying
I'm emotionally unstable lately.

133
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,400
And I feel like I can't control
my emotions either.

134
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:27,720
I just feel really anxious.

135
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:30,560
But anti-anxiety medication
during pregnancy

136
00:09:30,640 --> 00:09:31,480
needs to be used very cautiously.

137
00:09:32,160 --> 00:09:36,120
I don't think your condition
is severe enough to require medication.

138
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:38,600
I'd recommend
talking more with your family.

139
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:40,200
Get plenty of rest.

140
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:53,920
Richard.

141
00:09:55,920 --> 00:09:57,920
What couldn't be said over WeChat
that you had to come here?

142
00:10:02,520 --> 00:10:03,360
It's getting late.

143
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,760
-Let's grab dinner together.
-No, no.

144
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:08,200
I came here because I didn't
want to run into any colleagues.

145
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,840
I need to come clean about something.

146
00:10:17,560 --> 00:10:21,320
I used you as a decoy
to set a trap for Lin Long.

147
00:10:21,920 --> 00:10:24,760
She's the supervisor who forced me
to drink at Wanghu Pavilion Restaurant.

148
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:28,480
-What really happened?
-Someone's out to get me.

149
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,840
Get in.

150
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:39,120
Lin Long is really spiraling right now.

151
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:42,720
What if she keeps spreading rumors
while she's on leave?

152
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,480
You said the consulting circle is small.

153
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,600
Could this affect you?

154
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:53,200
That's what you're worried about?

155
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,120
You were so tough
when you dealt with Lin Long before.

156
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:01,000
Why are you so jumpy all of a sudden?

157
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:05,000
You gave me that nickname "poser".

158
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,520
So I guess I'm kind of
an eligible bachelor.

159
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:14,120
I've been around plenty of women,
married and single.

160
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,200
I've had all kinds of rumors
made up about me.

161
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,360
One more from you?

162
00:11:17,880 --> 00:11:18,880
It's not going to cause much of a stir.

163
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:28,160
If Sha Sha hadn't given me
that meaningful warning,

164
00:11:28,240 --> 00:11:30,800
I wouldn't be here
listening to you show off.

165
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:35,120
DON'T LET UNNECESSARY RUMORS
HOLD BACK YOUR GROWTH

166
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:40,560
Your boss told you to be careful,
and you came to warn me?

167
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,520
That night you drank so much.

168
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,280
That was with Tianhe Air'
senior management, right?

169
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:52,680
My little non-story
doesn't even count as juicy gossip,

170
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,600
so it's no big deal.

171
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:56,360
But Tianhe Air used to be state-owned.

172
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:58,240
It's the small oversights
that bring down whole empires.

173
00:11:58,840 --> 00:12:01,840
What if rumors about information leaks
or corporate spies start spreading

174
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,040
and people actually believe them?

175
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,520
It could hurt your project.

176
00:12:05,040 --> 00:12:06,320
And then you'll black out again.

177
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:12,240
I landed the Tianhe Air project

178
00:12:12,320 --> 00:12:14,720
because of years
of deep industry experience

179
00:12:14,800 --> 00:12:16,560
and C&amp;C Consulting's
unique management model.

180
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:19,320
Not some movie-style trade secret

181
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:22,000
where one stolen USB drive
brings down the whole company.

182
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:25,280
And I don't think Sha Sha was warning you.

183
00:12:25,880 --> 00:12:27,160
She really sees potential in you.

184
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,800
That's why she was giving you advice.

185
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:32,600
After all, women face a lot more trouble
in the workplace than men do.

186
00:12:35,520 --> 00:12:37,680
-Buckle up.
-What for?

187
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,920
You got promoted.
You have to treat me to dinner, right?

188
00:12:45,960 --> 00:12:48,160
Happy to treat you.

189
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,360
But don't go overboard.

190
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:51,840
This place doesn't look cheap.

191
00:12:51,920 --> 00:12:53,080
-Come on.
-Let's toast.

192
00:12:53,760 --> 00:12:54,800
Come on.

193
00:13:00,360 --> 00:13:02,440
Hey, would you…?

194
00:13:03,040 --> 00:13:04,320
I chose this place on purpose.

195
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:06,200
People from the Da'ai Foundation
Consulting Industry Chapter

196
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:07,880
have dinner here every month.

197
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:10,880
Wh-What are you doing?

198
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,040
You're worried about rumors, right?

199
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,440
Let me teach you something.

200
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:16,680
The best way to manage
a potential crisis isn't to avoid it.

201
00:13:16,760 --> 00:13:19,360
It's to take the initiative
and give the rumors no place to land.

202
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:20,920
Let's go.

203
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,160
Du!

204
00:13:25,480 --> 00:13:27,200
You're all here. What a coincidence.

205
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:28,720
Uh…

206
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:31,800
Wh… Who's this?

207
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,200
This is our little junior, Xu Chi.

208
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:39,120
Her family asked me to look out for her,
but she ended up at Maxmise on her own.

209
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,960
Let me introduce you. This is Du.

210
00:13:42,560 --> 00:13:44,000
He used to be at Boen.
Now he's out on his own.

211
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,040
Hello, Du.

212
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:47,960
I don't need to introduce Sha Sha, do I?

213
00:13:48,960 --> 00:13:50,920
-Ms. Sha.
-Sha Sha.

214
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,400
This girl has
a really stubborn personality.

215
00:13:52,480 --> 00:13:54,240
Keep her in line at the office.

216
00:13:55,480 --> 00:13:56,680
Xinzhi, why are you being
so formal with me?

217
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:59,040
She's already key to my team now.

218
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,040
She just came in
through campus recruiting,

219
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:02,720
and she's already an SBA.

220
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,480
Du.

221
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:06,680
Give us an introduction.

222
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:10,080
Oh, we're from
the Da'ai Foundation Consulting Chapter.

223
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,280
Let's go around.

224
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:15,160
Come on. This is Wang Teng
from Tengfei Consulting.

225
00:14:15,240 --> 00:14:17,120
Hello. I'm Wang Teng
from Tengfei Consulting.

226
00:14:17,200 --> 00:14:18,480
-Hello. I'm Xu Chi.
-Just call me Wang.

227
00:14:18,560 --> 00:14:20,520
-Mr. Wang.
-This is Wu.

228
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:22,320
Wu Ming from Haowang Consulting.

229
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:23,760
-Hello.
-Wang is actually quite young.

230
00:14:23,840 --> 00:14:25,040
He just looks older than his age.

231
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,440
-Not at all.
-You really don't know how to talk.

232
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,760
Thank you.

233
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:39,000
What, you're mad at me?

234
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:42,200
Upset that I turned
a perfectly decent young professional

235
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:43,560
into a nepotism hire?

236
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:46,840
A little.

237
00:14:47,680 --> 00:14:50,160
But I don't really have the right
to be precious about it.

238
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,080
Your method really did work.

239
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:56,400
Now that I'm your junior,
no one will misunderstand,

240
00:14:56,480 --> 00:14:58,480
and my path forward is clearer.

241
00:15:00,560 --> 00:15:02,240
There's nothing wrong
with being my junior.

242
00:15:02,760 --> 00:15:04,440
Even Sha Sha calls me senior.

243
00:15:05,040 --> 00:15:07,360
I didn't do much. Just said a few words.

244
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:10,040
At most, it'll keep Sha Sha from being
wary of you for pushing Lin Long out.

245
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:15,280
Your friend Bu Tianna
is the one with the real connections.

246
00:15:16,440 --> 00:15:18,880
Bu Tianna doesn't rely entirely
on connections.

247
00:15:18,960 --> 00:15:20,600
She works hard on her own too.

248
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:24,680
You need to let go
of that student mentality.

249
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:29,640
I know. That's why I keep telling her
it's not shameful to use her network.

250
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:32,840
That's exactly what I mean
by student mentality.

251
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:34,760
What do you mean by "not shameful"?

252
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:36,920
What do you mean by "she doesn't
rely entirely on connections"?

253
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:42,240
Those words imply that you're okay
with accepting help in your career,

254
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:44,200
but deep down, you look down on it.

255
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:46,120
Miss, times have changed.

256
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:48,320
Consulting isn't some glamorous industry.

257
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:50,200
It's just about making money
for companies.

258
00:15:50,280 --> 00:15:54,080
If you can't understand
society and capital faster than others,

259
00:15:54,600 --> 00:15:55,680
you won't last long in this job.

260
00:15:57,320 --> 00:16:00,880
Is refusing help
also a form of student mentality?

261
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,320
You caught my subtext?

262
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:08,360
Someone like me,
who fought all the way up,

263
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:10,600
has never gotten lucky.

264
00:16:10,680 --> 00:16:12,280
But you've been too good to me.

265
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:15,480
You only interviewed me once,
and you've given me so much guidance.

266
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:17,040
I…

267
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,520
Don't get too excited.

268
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,760
Sometimes free things
are the most expensive.

269
00:16:22,560 --> 00:16:23,760
Now I'm a partner.

270
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:25,680
I'll need one or two trusted people.

271
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:28,480
Not company people. Mine personally.

272
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,920
So I can have them handle things
I can't do myself,

273
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,520
without leaking any trade secrets.

274
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:38,320
And you could be that person.

275
00:16:39,240 --> 00:16:40,680
That's why I've been paving
the way for you a bit.

276
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:44,800
But whether it works out or not
depends on you.

277
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:51,320
Yes, my lord.

278
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:54,480
You didn't even think it over
before saying yes?

279
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:56,280
My instincts already made the call.

280
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,000
Ambition has always driven me forward.

281
00:16:58,680 --> 00:17:01,040
Working for a partner of
C&amp;C Consulting for a year

282
00:17:01,120 --> 00:17:03,880
will teach me more than three years
of figuring things out on my own.

283
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:06,359
The sooner I become a consultant,

284
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:09,160
the closer I get to my dream
and my mom's old apartment.

285
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,599
Why wouldn't I seize
such a good opportunity?

286
00:17:11,319 --> 00:17:13,319
So, what do you need me to do?

287
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,520
First, finish what's on your plate.

288
00:17:16,599 --> 00:17:18,880
Let me see that you have the ability
to complete a whole project on your own.

289
00:17:19,839 --> 00:17:21,119
Send me your personal email.

290
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,960
I have some public materials.

291
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:24,079
Go through them when you have time.

292
00:17:29,880 --> 00:17:31,720
What, not enough work?

293
00:17:31,800 --> 00:17:33,560
You'll cry from how exhausted you'll be.

294
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:46,480
<i>I don't think your condition</i>
<i>is severe enough to require medication.</i>

295
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:49,160
<i>I'd recommend</i>
<i>talking more with your family.</i>

296
00:17:49,240 --> 00:17:50,280
<i>Get plenty of rest.</i>

297
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,280
You're back.

298
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,480
So you're home.

299
00:18:12,560 --> 00:18:14,840
I messaged you saying I made dinner
and was waiting for you.

300
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,080
Didn't you see it?

301
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,920
I've been busy all day.
Didn't check my phone.

302
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:19,080
I already ate.

303
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:22,040
I haven't eaten yet. Eat with me.

304
00:18:26,240 --> 00:18:28,320
Zhiwen, I shouldn't have lost my temper

305
00:18:28,400 --> 00:18:31,040
about your dad buying
the apartment last time.

306
00:18:31,120 --> 00:18:33,080
But you know I've been
emotionally unstable during pregnancy.

307
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:34,880
But I won't do that anymore.

308
00:18:34,960 --> 00:18:37,560
I've already applied
for early maternity leave.

309
00:18:37,640 --> 00:18:38,880
I'm coming home to rest now.

310
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:40,320
You won't have to order takeout anymore.

311
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,080
Just come home early after work.

312
00:18:42,160 --> 00:18:43,680
I'll make you dinner.

313
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:44,960
Alright?

314
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:52,040
Here. Try this.

315
00:18:52,120 --> 00:18:53,120
It's your favorite.

316
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:54,800
I made it just for you.

317
00:19:00,600 --> 00:19:01,880
Zhiwen, just have a taste.

318
00:19:01,960 --> 00:19:03,360
The food's getting cold.

319
00:19:03,440 --> 00:19:06,880
I'm not coming home late
because of overtime.

320
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:08,200
I've been at the gym.

321
00:19:08,840 --> 00:19:12,120
I haven't touched carbs or greasy food
for almost a month now.

322
00:19:12,920 --> 00:19:15,440
Do you even listen to anything I say?

323
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:18,720
Well, you don't pay attention
to my stuff either.

324
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:22,800
The doctor called you today about my risk
of premature labor, right?

325
00:19:23,840 --> 00:19:25,040
I was there listening.

326
00:19:25,120 --> 00:19:27,360
I had her hang up
because I didn't want you to worry.

327
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:31,440
Have you said one caring thing
to me since you walked in?

328
00:19:31,520 --> 00:19:33,720
I knew you were setting this up.

329
00:19:34,320 --> 00:19:37,760
You just want to play the sick card
and force me to bow down to you.

330
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,920
Who's forcing you?

331
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:41,560
I am apologizing to you.

332
00:19:42,160 --> 00:19:43,840
I made this whole table of food.

333
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:45,320
I already gave in first.

334
00:19:45,400 --> 00:19:46,480
What more do you want from me?

335
00:19:46,560 --> 00:19:47,560
Come on.

336
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:52,600
You just wanted to show off
how hardworking and virtuous you are.

337
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:55,080
Like I'm forcing a pregnant woman
to do housework.

338
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,880
Can't we hire a cleaner?

339
00:19:56,960 --> 00:19:58,320
Can't we order takeout?

340
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,400
I just want to know this.

341
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:03,560
Why do you always have to look down
on me from your moral high ground?

342
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:06,760
Jiang Zhiwen,
have some conscience, will you?

343
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,280
Look at my condition right now.

344
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:10,880
Even if you're just pretending,

345
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:13,760
can you at least act like
you care about me?

346
00:20:15,240 --> 00:20:17,080
I really don't feel well right now.

347
00:20:17,160 --> 00:20:18,400
My body feels awful.

348
00:20:18,480 --> 00:20:20,080
Work isn't going well either.

349
00:20:20,160 --> 00:20:22,160
Knowing me, do you think I'd be home

350
00:20:22,240 --> 00:20:24,560
on maternity leave this early
if I had a choice?

351
00:20:28,240 --> 00:20:29,840
From now on, do whatever you want.

352
00:20:29,920 --> 00:20:31,320
Just don't drag me into it.

353
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:34,800
When your due date comes,
I'll take you to the hospital.

354
00:20:35,720 --> 00:20:36,960
After that, we go our separate ways.

355
00:20:39,160 --> 00:20:40,000
Jiang Zhiwen, don't leave!

356
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:41,120
Come back here and explain yourself!

357
00:20:41,760 --> 00:20:44,720
Are you trying to force me into divorce
with this cold treatment?

358
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:46,560
Are you crazy?

359
00:20:46,640 --> 00:20:47,480
Who said anything about divorce?

360
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:50,680
I just can't stand listening to you.

361
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:52,560
Just have the baby safely.

362
00:20:52,640 --> 00:20:54,440
We'll still have that bond
as husband and wife.

363
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:57,400
Don't keep using divorce as a weapon.

364
00:20:57,480 --> 00:20:59,320
Otherwise, you'll end up with nothing!

365
00:21:17,280 --> 00:21:18,560
Bye, my lord.

366
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:25,480
Why didn't you drive her home?

367
00:21:26,120 --> 00:21:27,360
Her place is really close to mine.

368
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:29,480
-Why would I?
-Close?

369
00:21:29,560 --> 00:21:31,200
Then you should definitely drive her home.

370
00:21:31,280 --> 00:21:32,680
You're failing as an elder.

371
00:21:32,760 --> 00:21:33,880
I told her I have things to do later.

372
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,360
Wait, what's going on with you two?

373
00:21:36,440 --> 00:21:38,000
Now you're drawing a line?

374
00:21:38,080 --> 00:21:40,240
You were protecting her so much
when people were around.

375
00:21:40,320 --> 00:21:42,360
You two couldn't stop talking
during dinner.

376
00:21:42,440 --> 00:21:43,520
She's different from the others.

377
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:46,960
Different how?

378
00:21:47,040 --> 00:21:48,040
Don't give me that smirk.

379
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,680
I see her as half a protege.

380
00:21:49,760 --> 00:21:52,520
Management consulting
is basically partners

381
00:21:52,600 --> 00:21:54,040
leading their own teams into the field.

382
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:55,600
I need my own trusted people.

383
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,280
The ones before weren't cutting it.

384
00:21:57,360 --> 00:21:59,680
Finally found someone with both
emotional intelligence and ability.

385
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:01,200
Of course, I'm going to lock her down.

386
00:22:01,760 --> 00:22:05,920
So are you going to bring her
into your Monte Cristo Plan?

387
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
Not yet. Let's develop her first.

388
00:22:08,080 --> 00:22:09,400
We'll see if she's up to it.

389
00:22:16,320 --> 00:22:19,440
<i>Now I'm a partner,</i>
<i>I'll need one or two trusted people.</i>

390
00:22:19,520 --> 00:22:21,800
<i>Not company people. Mine personally.</i>

391
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:24,080
And you could be that person.

392
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:27,840
But whether it works out or not
depends on you.

393
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:30,320
<i>Working for a partner of</i>
<i>C&amp;C Consulting for a year</i>

394
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:33,440
<i>will teach me more than three years</i>
<i>of figuring things out on my own.</i>

395
00:22:33,520 --> 00:22:35,280
<i>The sooner I become a consultant,</i>

396
00:22:35,360 --> 00:22:38,240
<i>the closer I get to my dream</i>
<i>and my mom's old apartment.</i>

397
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:45,200
<i>I've been trying hard to become</i>
<i>a qualified consultant as soon as I can.</i>

398
00:22:45,280 --> 00:22:47,880
<i>Not just for the money</i>
<i>and my mom's old apartment.</i>

399
00:22:48,560 --> 00:22:51,440
I also hope that one day,

400
00:22:52,080 --> 00:22:55,480
I can be as strong and smart as you,

401
00:22:55,560 --> 00:22:58,400
<i>stay calm, and handle anything with ease.</i>

402
00:23:11,800 --> 00:23:12,760
Hello?

403
00:23:13,280 --> 00:23:15,800
<i>I'm almost done</i>
<i>with the Ande Energy contract.</i>

404
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:18,720
But Mr. Pi is planning
to add Lu Le to the project.

405
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:21,480
Lu Le is close with Lin Long.

406
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:26,880
<i>Do you think she'll stir up trouble</i>
<i>on my project because she resents you?</i>

407
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:30,080
Should I have Ande Energy reject her?

408
00:23:30,160 --> 00:23:31,680
<i>Why bother? First,</i>

409
00:23:31,760 --> 00:23:34,240
you need to trust that Maxmise consultants
are professional enough.

410
00:23:34,320 --> 00:23:37,800
Second, she's been helping
Lin Long all this time

411
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:40,360
and still couldn't touch me. Right?

412
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:42,800
<i>Third, even if she tries something,</i>

413
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:45,880
responding after she makes her move
puts you in a higher position.

414
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:47,400
That's true.

415
00:23:47,920 --> 00:23:49,360
One of the reasons I like you

416
00:23:49,440 --> 00:23:52,760
is that communication
with you is so efficient.

417
00:23:53,280 --> 00:23:54,480
-Bye.
-<i>Hold on.</i>

418
00:23:55,600 --> 00:23:59,720
I actually have something
I want your advice on.

419
00:24:01,600 --> 00:24:03,360
<i>If, just if,</i>

420
00:24:03,960 --> 00:24:06,880
a really tempting opportunity
comes your way,

421
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:12,040
and you've already said yes,
but afterwards, you feel it's risky,

422
00:24:13,240 --> 00:24:15,160
-would you regret it?
-<i>No.</i>

423
00:24:15,240 --> 00:24:17,800
Because my instincts
already made the call.

424
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:22,520
<i>And honestly, you don't get</i>
<i>many lucky breaks in life.</i>

425
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:23,720
<i>Miss one and it's gone.</i>

426
00:24:23,800 --> 00:24:25,680
So what if there's risk?

427
00:24:26,280 --> 00:24:28,240
We're still young. We can afford to lose.

428
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:29,760
Yeah.

429
00:24:31,280 --> 00:24:33,640
-Thanks.
-Bye.

430
00:24:56,840 --> 00:24:57,680
BOLO CULTURE, MAXMISE CONSULTING

431
00:24:58,600 --> 00:24:59,520
Thanks.

432
00:24:59,600 --> 00:25:01,440
-Great!
-Pleasure working with you.

433
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:11,480
I landed this project with Bolo Culture.

434
00:25:11,560 --> 00:25:13,360
But that's just the first step.

435
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:16,160
I will become who you are now.

436
00:25:16,240 --> 00:25:17,240
<i>I definitely will.</i>

437
00:25:29,200 --> 00:25:30,640
-Dad! Mom!
-Tianna.

438
00:25:33,960 --> 00:25:35,480
Watch where you're going!

439
00:25:36,080 --> 00:25:37,000
What's wrong?

440
00:25:37,760 --> 00:25:38,680
What's wrong, Nana?

441
00:25:38,760 --> 00:25:40,360
You love Zhang's crispy pastries.

442
00:25:40,440 --> 00:25:42,080
I drove out of my way to buy them,

443
00:25:42,160 --> 00:25:43,720
and this little brat
knocked them all over.

444
00:25:43,800 --> 00:25:45,080
What little brat?

445
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,400
That's your brother.

446
00:25:47,240 --> 00:25:48,840
Yeah! I'm not a brat!

447
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,800
Honestly. Always causing trouble
when you're home.

448
00:25:50,880 --> 00:25:52,840
Do you even act like an older sister?

449
00:25:53,440 --> 00:25:55,680
Dad, I… I just gave him
a little talking-to.

450
00:25:55,760 --> 00:25:57,160
I didn't even hit him.

451
00:25:57,240 --> 00:25:58,160
How is that causing trouble?

452
00:25:58,760 --> 00:26:00,480
Why are you picking on our girl?

453
00:26:01,080 --> 00:26:02,880
You haven't seen Nana in almost a month.

454
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:05,600
Have a good chat with her.

455
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:06,520
Okay.

456
00:26:15,400 --> 00:26:16,800
-No, I don't want it!
-Xiaojie.

457
00:26:26,760 --> 00:26:29,280
Nana. Here, have some food. Eat up.

458
00:26:29,360 --> 00:26:30,760
You haven't been home in a while.

459
00:26:30,840 --> 00:26:32,680
Have some food. It's your favorite.

460
00:26:32,760 --> 00:26:33,600
Dig in.

461
00:26:34,680 --> 00:26:36,360
It's the weekend tomorrow.

462
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:38,560
Go play some ball with your dad.

463
00:26:38,640 --> 00:26:40,560
Mr. Huang will be there too.

464
00:26:41,080 --> 00:26:43,760
His son is a year older than you.

465
00:26:43,840 --> 00:26:45,600
He's a VP at an investment bank.

466
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:48,160
You young people should connect more.

467
00:26:48,240 --> 00:26:52,280
Who knows, maybe his firm
could invest in yours.

468
00:26:54,000 --> 00:26:56,120
If you want me to go on a blind date,
just say so.

469
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:57,920
Don't beat around the bush.

470
00:26:58,760 --> 00:27:02,480
Besides, Maxmise
is a globally recognized consulting firm.

471
00:27:02,560 --> 00:27:03,880
We don't need investment.

472
00:27:04,440 --> 00:27:07,120
And VPs are a dime a dozen
at investment banks.

473
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:08,600
CEOs are everywhere.

474
00:27:08,680 --> 00:27:10,360
Whether he's young and successful
is still up in the air.

475
00:27:11,800 --> 00:27:13,680
How dare you talk
to your mother like that?

476
00:27:15,800 --> 00:27:16,840
You…

477
00:27:17,440 --> 00:27:19,000
You're not even as polite as Jie.

478
00:27:19,080 --> 00:27:20,400
Yeah! So rude!

479
00:27:20,480 --> 00:27:22,360
Bad Tianna!

480
00:27:22,440 --> 00:27:25,000
-Eat up. Eat.
-Bad Tianna!

481
00:27:30,360 --> 00:27:32,920
Anyway, you're coming with me
to see Mr. Huang tomorrow.

482
00:27:33,520 --> 00:27:35,720
He's watched you grow up.

483
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:38,280
He wants to see you,
and you're making excuses.

484
00:27:38,800 --> 00:27:40,040
What kind of behavior is that?

485
00:27:41,520 --> 00:27:42,720
Who's the one behaving badly?

486
00:27:43,320 --> 00:27:45,800
Bu Tianjie is young,
and he's already cursing at me.

487
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,280
Why aren't you doing anything about it?

488
00:27:47,360 --> 00:27:49,680
I make a few casual remarks,
and you scold me.

489
00:27:49,760 --> 00:27:51,120
Fine, I'll be direct.

490
00:27:51,200 --> 00:27:52,960
I don't even know Mr. Huang,

491
00:27:53,040 --> 00:27:54,680
and I'm not at the age
where I'm desperate to get married.

492
00:27:54,760 --> 00:27:55,920
I'm not going on a blind date.

493
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:57,000
Alright, alright. Stop talking.

494
00:27:57,080 --> 00:27:58,800
If you don't want to go, don't go.

495
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,280
Tell us about your work.

496
00:28:00,360 --> 00:28:02,760
Let your dad give you some advice.

497
00:28:07,120 --> 00:28:08,120
Yeah, yeah.

498
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:09,400
Go ahead.

499
00:28:09,480 --> 00:28:12,280
Your mom said
you're about to sign a contract.

500
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:17,720
It's a strategic cooperation
with Ande Energy.

501
00:28:17,800 --> 00:28:19,640
That project will probably
last a whole year.

502
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,880
Ande Energy?

503
00:28:21,960 --> 00:28:24,720
Isn't that the company
Yan Hongjun just acquired?

504
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:29,520
That kid sure knows how to do me a favor.

505
00:28:29,600 --> 00:28:33,440
I heard Hongjun's son made it
into one of the Red Circle law firms.

506
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:35,720
I heard that kid speaks great French.

507
00:28:35,800 --> 00:28:36,720
Right?

508
00:28:37,320 --> 00:28:38,520
Pretty impressive.

509
00:28:40,280 --> 00:28:43,640
Should we sign Jie up
for a foreign language class?

510
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:45,600
I think he has great language skills.

511
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:48,240
Maybe French and German. Spanish too.

512
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,440
Can't let him fall behind already.

513
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:52,440
All the neighbor kids are taking classes.

514
00:28:52,960 --> 00:28:53,800
Should we maybe…?

515
00:28:54,520 --> 00:28:56,280
Dad, Mom. Work just called me.

516
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:57,480
I need to go back to the office.

517
00:28:57,560 --> 00:28:58,800
You two enjoy your meal.

518
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:22,800
Hello?

519
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:23,800
<i>Chi.</i>

520
00:29:25,000 --> 00:29:26,760
<i>Come drink with me right now.</i>

521
00:29:26,840 --> 00:29:27,720
You…

522
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:32,760
I'll go with you.

523
00:29:33,920 --> 00:29:35,400
No need.

524
00:29:35,480 --> 00:29:36,320
You sure?

525
00:29:36,400 --> 00:29:38,600
What if she gets drunk
and starts acting crazy?

526
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:40,400
Can you handle it alone?

527
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:43,480
Let's go.

528
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:54,640
Hey beautiful.

529
00:29:54,720 --> 00:29:56,000
Want a drink?

530
00:30:02,080 --> 00:30:03,480
-Still want one?
-Ow, ow.

531
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:06,840
Scram.

532
00:30:40,840 --> 00:30:42,240
Why aren't you asking me why?

533
00:30:42,840 --> 00:30:44,800
You'll tell me when you're ready.

534
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,480
I'm telling you,

535
00:30:53,320 --> 00:30:55,720
I really wanted to get drunk tonight.

536
00:30:56,400 --> 00:31:01,480
But there's this voice
in my head reminding me that

537
00:31:02,520 --> 00:31:05,960
I haven't finished the recommendations
for the Ande Energy project.

538
00:31:06,640 --> 00:31:09,640
What if I wake up
with a hangover tomorrow?

539
00:31:09,720 --> 00:31:10,560
What do I do?

540
00:31:10,640 --> 00:31:12,320
Worry about tomorrow when it comes.

541
00:31:12,920 --> 00:31:13,960
I'll drink with you.

542
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:15,560
I brought a driver.

543
00:31:30,600 --> 00:31:31,440
Easy.

544
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:50,880
Chi.

545
00:31:52,200 --> 00:31:53,600
You're so good to me.

546
00:31:55,320 --> 00:31:57,400
Of course I am.

547
00:31:57,920 --> 00:32:00,880
I'm pretty, kind-hearted
and easy to push over.

548
00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:02,640
I just don't have your figure.

549
00:32:07,200 --> 00:32:09,000
Let me ask you something.

550
00:32:09,080 --> 00:32:12,160
Do you really not remember
that time a few years ago

551
00:32:12,240 --> 00:32:15,720
at Anyang Road subway station
when you helped someone?

552
00:32:16,240 --> 00:32:17,360
Hel…

553
00:32:17,440 --> 00:32:18,280
FIVE YEARS AGO

554
00:32:18,360 --> 00:32:19,800
Where are you?

555
00:32:19,880 --> 00:32:21,400
Reply to me.

556
00:32:21,920 --> 00:32:24,080
I haven't eaten in over 12 hours.

557
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:31,600
What's wrong? Are you okay?

558
00:32:32,280 --> 00:32:34,080
I think I have low blood sugar.

559
00:32:34,600 --> 00:32:35,520
Feeling a bit dizzy.

560
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:37,800
I just bought some orange juice.

561
00:32:37,880 --> 00:32:38,720
Do you want some?

562
00:32:38,800 --> 00:32:40,000
Have a little.

563
00:32:45,600 --> 00:32:48,440
I also have bread and crackers.

564
00:32:48,520 --> 00:32:49,440
Do you want some?

565
00:32:51,360 --> 00:32:52,680
Easy, easy.

566
00:32:53,720 --> 00:32:55,160
Slow down. Take your time.

567
00:32:59,400 --> 00:33:00,240
Want some?

568
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:06,200
Thanks.

569
00:33:10,080 --> 00:33:13,240
You… You're that girl who passed out?

570
00:33:13,320 --> 00:33:15,240
The one with low blood sugar?

571
00:33:18,080 --> 00:33:19,640
You're so slow.

572
00:33:19,720 --> 00:33:22,040
Why did it take you this long
to figure it out?

573
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:24,280
Let me tell you something, Chi.

574
00:33:24,360 --> 00:33:26,400
You saved me that day.

575
00:33:26,480 --> 00:33:30,640
I'm going to be really,
really good to you from now on.

576
00:33:36,560 --> 00:33:38,280
I'm in applied statistics.

577
00:33:39,520 --> 00:33:40,800
Not answering directly?

578
00:33:40,880 --> 00:33:43,320
Guess your school and name
aren't worth mentioning.

579
00:33:43,400 --> 00:33:45,440
With this job market,

580
00:33:45,520 --> 00:33:48,360
even Maxmise cut 10%
of their senior staff.

581
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,720
Since we're bound to compete,

582
00:33:50,360 --> 00:33:52,200
why bother pretending to be all friendly?

583
00:33:52,280 --> 00:33:54,840
You're pretty confident
in your abilities, huh?

584
00:33:57,800 --> 00:34:00,000
MAXMISE, SHAPING THE FUTURE TOGETHER

585
00:34:08,360 --> 00:34:09,400
Let me ask you.

586
00:34:09,480 --> 00:34:12,199
Do you know why I was there that day?

587
00:34:13,719 --> 00:34:15,080
How would I know?

588
00:34:16,280 --> 00:34:17,440
I'll tell you.

589
00:34:20,120 --> 00:34:21,920
What does this consent form mean?

590
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:24,000
You're making my mom risk
having a baby at her age?

591
00:34:24,600 --> 00:34:26,199
Is having a son really that important?

592
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:31,520
-Na!
-Tianna!

593
00:34:31,600 --> 00:34:34,080
Do you really have to have a son
to be the heir?

594
00:34:35,880 --> 00:34:37,639
I'm already 20 years old.

595
00:34:38,520 --> 00:34:41,760
My parents had a boy behind my back.

596
00:34:42,560 --> 00:34:44,320
Why?

597
00:34:46,560 --> 00:34:48,360
Am I not their beloved daughter?

598
00:34:49,520 --> 00:34:50,600
Am I?

599
00:34:51,920 --> 00:34:52,880
No, I'm not.

600
00:34:53,679 --> 00:34:56,040
All they care about is their son.

601
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,840
What little brat?

602
00:34:57,920 --> 00:34:59,160
That's your brother.

603
00:34:59,880 --> 00:35:01,400
Honestly. Always causing trouble
when you're home.

604
00:35:02,000 --> 00:35:03,120
Do you act like an older sister?

605
00:35:04,200 --> 00:35:07,880
I have been pouring everything

606
00:35:07,960 --> 00:35:10,400
into the Ande Energy project,
day and night,

607
00:35:11,080 --> 00:35:13,520
just to prove to him

608
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:15,600
that I'm capable
of taking over his business.

609
00:35:15,680 --> 00:35:16,760
But he…

610
00:35:21,320 --> 00:35:22,520
He doesn't care at all.

611
00:35:22,600 --> 00:35:23,760
Ande Energy?

612
00:35:24,800 --> 00:35:27,520
Isn't that the company
Yan Hongjun just acquired?

613
00:35:28,640 --> 00:35:31,880
That kid sure knows how to do me a favor.

614
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:34,680
He doesn't care about me at all.

615
00:35:42,440 --> 00:35:44,360
-On their behalf, I'll apolo--
-Shut up!

616
00:35:45,320 --> 00:35:48,600
Listen, I know exactly
what's on your mind.

617
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:50,680
You're thinking

618
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:54,280
that even if most of the Bu family money
goes to my brother,

619
00:35:54,360 --> 00:35:56,240
some of it will still come to me, right?

620
00:35:56,880 --> 00:35:58,000
You're thinking that money

621
00:35:58,080 --> 00:36:01,240
would be enough to turn your whole
family's fortunes around, aren't you?

622
00:36:02,040 --> 00:36:03,160
I'm sorry.

623
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,800
You're wrong.

624
00:36:04,880 --> 00:36:06,000
I'm not that kind of person.

625
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:07,800
I don't have that much value to offer.

626
00:36:07,880 --> 00:36:08,800
So wake up!

627
00:36:09,840 --> 00:36:10,800
I don't need to wake up.

628
00:36:10,880 --> 00:36:14,400
Because how much value you have
is for me to decide, not you--

629
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:21,040
You awake?

630
00:36:24,560 --> 00:36:25,600
Okay.

631
00:36:25,680 --> 00:36:26,800
Here.

632
00:36:26,880 --> 00:36:28,320
Pour it on this jacket too.

633
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:31,280
Knowing you, you'll buy me
a new one anyway.

634
00:36:31,360 --> 00:36:32,320
I could use a new one.

635
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:35,120
<i>Why are you so guarded?</i>

636
00:36:36,240 --> 00:36:38,400
You really think everyone
is after your dad's money?

637
00:36:39,040 --> 00:36:44,480
You are pretty and capable.

638
00:36:44,560 --> 00:36:46,360
Can't I just be drawn to your personality?

639
00:36:50,800 --> 00:36:52,600
-Here.
-Wake up.

640
00:36:52,680 --> 00:36:54,440
Alright, alright. I'm waking up.

641
00:36:55,040 --> 00:36:56,800
-Here.
-Do you know where she lives?

642
00:36:56,880 --> 00:36:58,160
I've sent her something by courier before.

643
00:36:58,240 --> 00:37:01,200
-Just head to Bairui Apartments.
-Okay.

644
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:08,320
Great. I was thinking about
getting you two a hotel room.

645
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:10,400
So you've helped her before.

646
00:37:10,480 --> 00:37:12,160
No wonder she only likes you.

647
00:37:12,240 --> 00:37:14,480
Do you really like her?

648
00:37:15,400 --> 00:37:17,160
Who wouldn't like something beautiful?

649
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:20,320
What you do from now on
is not my business.

650
00:37:20,400 --> 00:37:22,960
But don't you dare hurt her.

651
00:37:23,040 --> 00:37:23,880
Otherwise…

652
00:37:23,960 --> 00:37:25,920
Otherwise, I'll end up like Lin Long.

653
00:37:26,560 --> 00:37:27,920
That's what you wanted to say, right?

654
00:37:28,800 --> 00:37:30,440
I am indeed a scheming guy.

655
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:32,640
But I'm a different kind of scheming guy.

656
00:37:33,560 --> 00:37:36,440
I don't have all those messy bad habits.

657
00:37:37,120 --> 00:37:38,640
Whatever our relationship becomes,

658
00:37:38,720 --> 00:37:41,400
at least for now,
I'm a decent male colleague, right?

659
00:37:43,440 --> 00:37:44,520
Don't look at me like that.

660
00:37:44,600 --> 00:37:45,720
It's creepy.

661
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:48,120
Alright. Get in.

662
00:38:02,640 --> 00:38:03,480
Easy.

663
00:38:03,560 --> 00:38:04,520
I'm not drunk.

664
00:38:04,600 --> 00:38:06,080
-Can you make it up on your own?
-Don't…

665
00:38:06,160 --> 00:38:07,000
Of course I can.

666
00:38:07,080 --> 00:38:08,200
Okay.

667
00:38:08,280 --> 00:38:13,200
Remember, no matter how bad things get,
you only get one night to indulge.

668
00:38:13,280 --> 00:38:15,840
Because the sadness is temporary.

669
00:38:15,920 --> 00:38:17,400
Your career is forever. Right?

670
00:38:18,520 --> 00:38:21,400
Fine. Next time you're upset,

671
00:38:21,480 --> 00:38:22,600
I'll comfort you the same way.

672
00:38:28,680 --> 00:38:30,200
What are you dodging for?

673
00:38:30,280 --> 00:38:31,400
I won't eat you alive.

674
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:35,200
Remember, I'm only paying
for dry cleaning on this jacket.

675
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:37,560
Forget the dry cleaning.

676
00:38:37,640 --> 00:38:39,200
Just have a meal with me.

677
00:38:41,880 --> 00:38:43,120
In your dreams.

678
00:38:44,440 --> 00:38:45,680
Bye.

679
00:38:45,760 --> 00:38:46,840
Take care.

680
00:38:50,680 --> 00:38:52,280
You two…

681
00:38:56,120 --> 00:38:57,840
Where are you going? Give me a ride.

682
00:38:57,920 --> 00:39:00,480
-We're not going the same way.
-Don't use me and toss me aside.

683
00:39:00,560 --> 00:39:02,040
We'll work together in the future.

684
00:39:02,120 --> 00:39:04,640
Those two surveys Lin Long left behind
are now on my plate.

685
00:39:04,720 --> 00:39:06,560
Let me know when you get there
tomorrow morning.

686
00:39:06,640 --> 00:39:07,600
Okay.
